⚡️🇺🇸🇰🇷 Hanwha Defense has made a forward offer to purchase the Australian owned ‘Austal USA’ Shipyard based out of Mobile Bay, Alabama, USA for roughly $1.5 Billion.

This is just months after Hanwha Defense had been approved to purchase the property and remnants of the disused and abandoned Philadelphia Naval Yard.

